{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"逆像"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"逆像"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><strong>逆像</strong> (inverse image) 是指"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"几何态射","text":"几何态射"}},{"Plain":"的左伴随部分.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"景的态射","text":"景的态射"}},{"Plain":" $f\\colon (\\mathcal C,J) \\to (\\mathcal D,K)$, 定义 $(\\mathcal C,J)$ 上的层 $F$ 的逆像 $f^*F$ 为\n$$\r\nf^*F(d) = \\operatorname{colim}_{f(c) \\to d} F(c),\r\n$$\n也即沿 $f$ 的左 "},{"Local":{"url":"Kan扩张","text":"Kan 扩张"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"直像-逆像伴随","text":"拓扑空间上的直像-逆像伴随"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}